# Add your project thumbnail images here

Place your project images in this folder:
- JPG format recommended
- Dimensions: 1200x800px optimal
- File naming: project-1.jpg, project-2.jpg, etc.

Example images:
- project-1-thumb.jpg (Commercial Brand Film)
- project-2-thumb.jpg (Motion Graphics Sequence)
- project-3-thumb.jpg (Documentary Color Grade)
- project-4-thumb.jpg (YouTube Shorts)
